## Key Commands for Reviewers

### Switching
show vlan brief
show interfaces trunk

### HSRP
show standby brief

### Routing
show ip route
show ip ospf neighbor
show ip route ospf

### NAT
show ip nat translations
show ip nat statistics

### DHCP
ipconfig /all

### Connectivity
ping 10.0.50.10
ping 198.51.100.10
